===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|baseball|softball}} The region of the [[field]] between the [[infield]] and the outer fence.
#: ''He hit a long fly ball to the '''outfield''' in the [[gap]] to left.''
# {{lb|en|cricket}} The region of the field roughly [[outside]] of the infield or the [[wicket-keeper]], [[slip]]s, [[gully]], [[point]], [[cover]], [[mid off]], [[mid on]], [[midwicket]] and [[square leg]].
# {{lb|en|Scotland|agriculture}} [[arable|Arable]] [[land]] continually [[crop]]ped without being [[manure]]d.
# {{lb|en|Scotland|agriculture}} Any open field at a distance from the [[farmsteading]].

